# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0079.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Client sensor snapshot + episode/request ID -> Request serialization + network transport: timestamped request
Request serialization + network transport -> Policy server queue + inference: uplink + server queue
Policy server queue + inference -> Response transport + timestamps: policy result
Response transport + timestamps -> Episode / generation / age / deadline gate: response + IDs + times
Episode / generation / age / deadline gate -> Chunk connection + command queue: accepted fresh result
Episode / generation / age / deadline gate -> Rejected / timeout local fallback: reject stale / late / wrong episode
Chunk connection + command queue -> Accepted command controller path: scheduled commands
Rejected / timeout local fallback -> Accepted command controller path: hold / retract / stop
Accepted command controller path -> Physical robot / environment: servo execution
Request serialization + network transport -> Latency + age telemetry: request transport time
Policy server queue + inference -> Latency + age telemetry: queue + inference time
Response transport + timestamps -> Latency + age telemetry: response transport time
Physical robot / environment -> Next timestamped client snapshot: physical feedback
Next timestamped client snapshot -> Client sensor snapshot + episode/request ID: next request cycle
